  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Ta có  <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hình chiếu vuông góc của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> lên mặt phẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Khi đó góc giữa đường <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và mặt phẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> bằng góc giữa hai đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></semantics></math> (vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></semantics></math> nhọn).<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hình vuông cạnh bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>a</mi></semantics></math> nên độ dài đường chéo <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>. Do đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông cân hay <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>45</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy góc giữa đường <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và mặt phẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msup><mn>45</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></semantics></math>.</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/f8900ec420c000e2d8a5a155ba6bf13835d11319dcdc5e765b1480d7add39189.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
